OL,3,GNEWSANHS gets #500m boost in Wales'
OL,4,Afirst budget under Plaid Cymru
OL,5,
OL,6,FA funding boost for the NHS has been
OL,7,Fincluded in Plaid Cymru's first budget,
OL,8,Fbut other public services could still
OL,9,Ffeel the pinch.
OL,11,FDespite an extra #500m to cut waiting
OL,12,Flists, spending on health will not rise
OL,13,Fas quickly as it has in recent years.
OL,15,FMoney has also been set aside to
OL,16,Fnegotiate a crucial political deal on
OL,17,Fthe budget ` the first since Plaid won
OL,18,Fpower at May's Senedd election.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
