OL,3,GNEWSANHS gets #500m boost in Wales'
OL,4,Afirst budget under Plaid Cymru
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are no changes to the rate of
OL,7,Fincome tax that the Welsh government
OL,8,Fcontrols, nor to the land transaction
OL,9,Ftax that is paid by people buying
OL,10,Fproperties.
